  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Not Just an Older-Adult Problem",
      "char_file": "손톱깎이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Ingrown toenails send about",
        "1 in 5 podiatry patients",
        "through the door",
        "",
        "They show up most in kids,",
        "young adults, and people",
        "in their 50s — check this first"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tight, Narrow-Toed Shoes",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Tight or narrow-toed shoes",
        "are one of the two",
        "leading causes",
        "",
        "Constant pressure from the sides",
        "pushes the nail's growth path",
        "inward instead of straight out"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Choose a Wide Toe Box",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Choose shoes with",
        "a wide toe box",
        "",
        "Give your toes room",
        "so nothing presses",
        "on the nail's edges"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rounding the Corners Too Short",
      "char_file": "손톱깎이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The other leading cause",
        "is how you're trimming",
        "",
        "Rounding the corners or cutting",
        "too short lets the skin puff up",
        "over the nail bed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trim Straight Across",
      "char_file": "손톱깎이_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Trim straight across and",
        "leave the corners visible",
        "past the skin",
        "",
        "Never round them or",
        "cut them too short"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Waiting Out Spreading Redness",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Once redness spreads or",
        "pus shows up, that's",
        "not a sign to wait it out",
        "",
        "The skin is already infected —",
        "with diabetes or poor circulation,",
        "it can escalate fast"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soak, Lift With Cotton, See a Doctor",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Soak your foot in warm water",
        "for 15 to 20 minutes",
        "",
        "Tuck a wisp of clean cotton",
        "under the corner to lift it,",
        "and see a doctor if it doesn't improve"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
